Three nutrients have exact individual amounts per two-milliliter serving: Vitamin B2 as riboflavin 5-phosphate at 0.5 milligrams, or 38 percent of the Daily Value; Vitamin B6 as pyridoxal 5-phosphate at 0.5 milligrams, or 29 percent of the Daily Value; and melatonin at 0.9 milligrams.

12
00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:23.360
