16
00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:37.170
Many adults recognize ingredients like melatonin, magnesium glycinate, L-theanine, or tart cherry from general nutrition articles.

17
00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:43.180
However, familiarity with individual ingredients is not the same thing as an independent clinical trial on this finished combined liquid formula.

18
00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:46.290
We have not verified clinical study proof for the finished YuSleep product.

19
00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:55.000
